      "kind": "construction",
      "description": "The San Francisco Savings Union's building, under construction to plans by Bliss & Faville: granite walls trimmed with bronze, a granite dome, and frontages on four streets, Grant Avenue, Market, O'Farrell and Bagley Place.",
